  'the 10-minute tick shares one isolate with 11 other jobs; the tick reads about 10,500 rows (largest statement 4,023) and stops starting cases after 85% of its wall budget'),
 ('breach-doctor-taint-guard', 'qnfo-fleet-control bdReadOnlyWhy() / bdWriteWhy() / bdFactsSafe(): playbook SQL and facts may hold only constants, numbers, ids and enum codes', 'guard', 'prompt injection from untrusted free text (issue bodies, cloud_ops_events text, exceptions_json) reaching the code loop or a probe through a trusted doctor issue', 0, 'keep', 'planned',
  'PLAN_TRUSTED and code_merge_trusted_sources are unchanged; doctor_taint_violations_24h reports every drop', NULL,
