 ('breach-doctor-action-allowlist', 'qnfo-fleet-control bdWriteWhy(): the only writes a playbook can make are one INSERT or UPDATE on six named tables, plus the three action kinds written in code', 'gate', 'a playbook row becoming arbitrary executable SQL', 0, 'keep', 'planned',
